sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MW as BindPathTenant<br/>middleware
    participant CTX as request context<br/>(pkg/requestctx)
    participant REPO as Repository
    participant PGCOMMON as pgcommon.RunInTx<br/>(GUCProvider)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    MW->>CTX: store tenantID in context
    REPO->>PGCOMMON: RunInTx(ctx, fn)
    PGCOMMON->>DB: BEGIN
    PGCOMMON->>DB: SET LOCAL app.tenant_id = '{tenantID}'
    Note over PGCOMMON,DB: RLS-6: SET LOCAL — transaction-scoped only.<br/>Never session-scoped. Never leaks across<br/>PgBouncer pooled backends.
    PGCOMMON->>DB: SET LOCAL app.tenant_id executed
    REPO->>DB: SELECT … (tenant_id via RLS policy)
    DB->>DB: RLS CHECK: current_setting('app.tenant_id') = tenant_id
    DB-->>REPO: filtered rows (own tenant only)
    PGCOMMON->>DB: COMMIT
    Note over DB: GUC cleared — pooled connection is safe<br/>to return to PgBouncer pool.

    Note over MW,DB: RLS-1: RLS enabled + forced on every tenant-scoped table.<br/>Cross-tenant reads return 0 rows (not an error) — CONC-1<br/>optimistic lock detects the resulting 0-row update.
